// Oracle batch 220: level 13's (Gemlik Base, the code's "Oltanis Orbit") own code on its real level data. Run with
// ORACLE_LEVEL=13 build/tests/ovl_oracle --batch 220 (needs the ISO; nothing else: the level is laid out from the disc).
// The subjects are the level's own mobys of each class (placed by its gameplay data) after the first gameplay frame,
// perturbed; the original is level 13's own function at its own address, the port the one registered for it (the
// hand-written gemlik_*.cpp, or the transliterations gemlik_classes_tr_N.cpp, generated by tools/codegen/mkall_l13.py
// from tools/codegen/gen/mkall/gemlik_classes.json); the section "P13.1" checks the hand-written ones on states built
// for them. Checked: the 60 class updates, the classes' 7 draw-list callbacks, sound emitter type 1,
// camera type 0x13 (accept / init / update), class 63's five hooks, the camera mode hook and its callback, the HUD
// element 0x11's draw function, and the Veldin ports of moby_spawn / mobys_in_sphere against level 13's copies.

